## Quality Checks (Required Before Every Commit)

Run these from the repository root:

```bash
# 1. Formatting
gofmt -w .

# 2. Imports, if goimports is installed
goimports -w .

# 3. Module cleanup
go mod tidy

# 4. Unit and integration tests
go test ./...

# 5. Race detector
go test -race ./...

# 6. Static checks
