+- Results
+  - Required checks passed.
+  - Focused persistence/state-machine suites passed.
+  - `golangci-lint` reported `0 issues`.
+  - `BE-0508` marked `passes: true` in `ralph/prd.json`.
+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - `goimports`, `staticcheck`, and `govulncheck` are not installed in this runner.
+  - No live Dokploy smoke was run; this story is Postgres/source-of-truth only and normal tests use local fakes/skips.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - API key lifecycle now has both a source-of-truth status and legacy lifecycle stamps; explicit state transitions should go through `APIKeyRepository.Transition`, while direct repository helpers such as `Revoke` remain low-level compatibility surfaces.
+  - Customer-facing revoke should keep the lifecycle event and audit event in the same transaction so the resource timeline and public audit trail cannot diverge.
+  - When adding a new observable lifecycle column to a tenant-scoped table, update existing byte-identical bystander helpers so cross-tenant mutation tests cover the new column.
